        <item>
            <title>Version 0.4.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jul 2026 05:37:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>支援直式螢幕：版型自動改成上下切（不再是不合理的窄長條），調色盤圖示也會畫成對應的直向比例</li>
                    <li>多螢幕環境下，每個螢幕依自己的方向（橫/直）各自判斷，一橫一直混用也沒問題</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure
                url="https://github.com/WillingHsieh/win_sizer_releases/releases/download/v0.4.1/win_sizer.dmg"
                sparkle:edSignature="9UgBGU2E39SGV+1CLTg/6+P2kL3fIA5TlrPB/KsaExEg34qQUc11U4rham3BY0ldoCFndJSBd1WYcwqCDbFWDQ=="
                length="1256057"
                type="application/octet-stream" />
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>Version 0.4.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jul 2026 04:53:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>選單支援多語言（English / 简体中文 / 繁體中文），預設跟隨系統語言，比對不到時退回英文</li>
                    <li>選單新增「Language」子選單可手動切換語言，立即生效</li>
                    <li>「About win_sizer」簡化成「About」</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure
                url="https://github.com/WillingHsieh/win_sizer_releases/releases/download/v0.4.0/win_sizer.dmg"
                sparkle:edSignature="ZamOvkMOm/AykUICeJEqaGYwz/sWxmifpTGEDzMr54hC2s/vc6UrjA2L6SvA5ncsrgjJO7mvtos3vaOSyht4BQ=="
