        <item>
            <title>Version 0.3.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jul 2026 03:11:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>新增「自動更新」選單，之後更新不用再手動下載/拖曳安裝</li>
                    <li>版型增加到 6 個：Left / Left more / Centre / Full Screen / Right more / Right</li>
                    <li>拖曳時滑鼠移到哪個版型圖示，邊框會即時變粗反饋</li>
                    <li>圖示整體加大，更容易命中</li>
                    <li>選單列新增 About 面板</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure
                url="https://github.com/WillingHsieh/win_sizer_releases/releases/download/v0.3.0/win_sizer.dmg"
